    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Original orientation and ambiguity fixture \u2014 MIT",
      "description": "Original generated 16-bit image, graph and code under the repository MIT license. Top row: vertical, diagonal and horizontal textures with 90/135/0 degree tangents. Bottom row: a corner-center probe, uniform patch and weak texture, each without a reliable direction at default limits. Select a tensor and inspect orientation, coherence, validity and eigenvalues. Zero orientation is meaningful only where valid is nonzero. Overview includes panel boundaries and text; selected probes exclude those. assets/truth.json stores generator-defined expectations.",
